  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fish Harbor - Phase II : Aden fishery harbour and artisanal landing sites in Aden, infrastructures and facilities are rehabilitated and equipped (AFH II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The phase II of the project aims to support the fisheries value chain through the completion of the rehabilitation/reconstruction of Aden fisheries harbour facilities not covered in phase I, rehabilitation of the Dockyard landing site in Mualla district (Aden) and through promoting livelihoods and employment along the value chain especially for women. At the same time the project shall contribute to rebuild better the fisheries governance and management capacities of related structures and autho</narrative>
  </description>
